```

But `sqlMany("listUsers")` — is the first arg the query name (registered) and second the params? sqlOne("getUser", {id}) — query name then params object. For no params, maybe sqlMany("listUsers") with one arg.

Rows: array of records. Response.json({ users: rows }).

